"novel_title": "凤逆天:杀手狂妃", "content_zh": "第六章 美男连城魅连城魅一怔，这个女人竟然这样明目张胆的看自己？这世上敢正视他的女人，除了他的母亲，再没有其他女人敢。而凰冷月一向胆小怯懦，素日见了自己只会脸红着跑开，她今天是怎么的，据说她打废了阿龙阿武两名家丁。起初他还不信，可是现在……连城魅俊美蹙起，沉思片刻，忽而温润的笑道，“好！既然是你想退，想必宁王和皇上也不会有话说，我这就去写休书来。”说罢，连城魅欣长的身躯正欲转身，却被凰冷月一个箭步上前阻拦。凰冷月扬起高傲的头，目光刺进连城魅瞳仁深处，咧嘴倾城一笑：“慢，我是说我要退婚，那休书自然是我来写！”冰冷的话，凰冷月转身走进石桌，拿起事先备好的笔墨纸砚，奋笔直书。片刻，笔落，凰冷月扬起那张铺满飞舞大字的白纸，朝着连城魅潇洒一扬“给你，从今起，我凰冷月正式的休了你，你，自由了！”嗯？！连城魅被凰冷月简单利落的动作给惊愕的大脑有些短路，他没幻视幻听吧。这个废物竟说休了他？前些天不是非自己不嫁，要寻死腻活么？眼前这个女人究竟是那个懦弱无能的凰冷月吗？见连城魅愣神，凰冷月直接潇洒的走到他的身边，把休书轻轻往他俊脸上盖去，傲然道：“收下吧！！慢走不送！”连城魅愣了许久，忽然邪魅一笑。他俯瞰凰冷月，轻笑，“你现在还不能走。按本国的法律，过门的妻子不满三个月就被休，是不算数的，除非……”连城魅修长的手指轻弹，那一纸龙飞凤舞的大字随风飞落。“除非什么？”凰冷月突然有一种不好的预感。连城魅嘴角扬起一抹冷，“除非你等到三个月后，为夫自然会让你走！”什么？！凰冷月心头一股怒火翻滚，望着近在咫尺的俊脸，咬牙道，“好，好的很！那我就等！”一甩袖，凰冷月愤愤离去。望着凰冷月窈窕的背影，连城魅秀气的眉头挑起，嘴角划过一丝玩味。这个女人，好像和之前不同了呢，唔……到底是哪里不同了呢，他也说不上来。不过他还有时间，不是吗？有生以来第一次，他发现本国的法律真的是可爱又及时！……凰冷月——西川国第一废柴女，嫁给本国第一天才美男连城魅的次日就掀起了轩然大、波。新婚夜独守空房，打残家丁，和连城魅退婚……等一系列重磅消息，接二连三的刷新着京城人们的承受能力。人们议论纷纷。天，这个废物是要逆天吗？打残家丁？她有这个功力？退婚？她没被气傻吧？连城魅那样的优质男人，是西川所有女人的向往，不说嫁给他，就是看上他一眼，也是好多女人这辈子的梦想。她倒好，走了狗屎运还嫌屎的颜色不纯。不过，废物就是废物，凰冷月就算勾、搭了连城魅，也还是一坨扶不上墙的烂泥。只要有灵力的人轻轻动一下手指，就能将凰冷月挫骨扬灰。于是所有的人都下了同一个结论：鸦始终是乌鸦，怎么也变不了凤凰！就算勉强飞上了枝头，也不过是插了凤凰毛的鸡！", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/fengnitian-shashoukuangfei/6.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 6 The handsome man Liancheng is charming Liancheng was startled, this woman actually looked at him so blatantly? Except for his mother, no other woman in the world dares to look him in the face. And Huang Lengyue has always been timid and cowardly. She would just blush and run away when she saw her. What happened to her today? It is said that she defeated two servants, Aaron and Wu. At first he didn't believe it, but now... Liancheng Meijun frowned, thought for a moment, and suddenly smiled warmly and said, \"Okay! Since you want to retreat, Prince Ning and the Emperor will probably have nothing to say, so I will write a letter of divorce.\" After saying that, Liancheng Meixin's long body was about to turn around, but Huang Lengyue stepped forward to stop her. Huang Lengyue raised her proud head, her eyes pierced into the depths of Liancheng's charming pupils, and she gave a charming smile: \"Hold on, I want to break off the engagement, so of course I will write the divorce letter!\" With cold words, Huang Lengyue turned around and walked into the stone table, picked up the pen, ink, paper and inkstone that had been prepared in advance, and started writing straight away. After a moment, the pen fell, and Huang Lengyue raised the white paper covered with flying large characters, and said to Liancheng Mei, \"Here you are, from now on, I, Huang Lengyue, officially divorce you, and you are free!\" Huh? ! Lian Chengmei was stunned by Huang Lengyue's simple and neat movements, and his brain was short-circuited. He didn't have any visual or auditory hallucinations. This loser actually said he was divorced? A few days ago, wasn't it true that if I didn't get married, I would be looking for death and a life of boredom? Is the woman in front of me the cowardly and incompetent Huang Lengyue? Seeing Lian Chengmei stunned, Huang Lengyue walked up to him in a dashing way, gently put the divorce letter on his handsome face, and said proudly: \"Take it! Leave slowly without sending it away!\" Lian Chengmei was stunned for a long time, and suddenly smiled evilly. He looked down at Huang Lengyue and chuckled, \"You can't leave now. According to the laws of this country, if a divorced wife is divorced within three months, it will not count unless...\" Lian Chengmei's slender fingers flicked, and the big characters with flying dragons and phoenixes flew down in the wind. \"Unless what?\" Huang Lengyue suddenly had a bad premonition. Lian Chengmei's lips raised a hint of coldness, \"Unless you wait until three months later, my husband will naturally let you go!\" What? ! Huang Lengyue felt a surge of anger in her heart. Looking at the handsome face so close, she gritted her teeth and said, \"Okay, great! Then I'll wait!\" Huang Lengyue flicked her sleeves and left angrily. Looking at Huang Lengyue's graceful back, Liancheng Mei's delicate brows were raised, and a trace of amusement flashed across the corner of his mouth. This woman seemed to be different from before. Well...he couldn't tell what was different. But he still has time, doesn't he? For the first time in his life, he found that the laws of his country were really cute and timely! ... Huang Lengyue, the most useless girl in Xichuan Kingdom, caused an uproar the day after she married the most talented and handsome man in the country, Liancheng Mei. Staying alone in an empty house on the wedding night, maiming a servant, breaking off the engagement with Liancheng Mei... a series of blockbuster news, one after another, have refreshed the affordability of people in the capital. People were talking a lot. God, is this trash going to defy heaven? Cripple a servant? Does she have this ability? break off an engagement? She wasn't mad, was she? A high-quality man like Lian Chengmei is what all women in Xichuan yearn for. Not only marrying him, but even taking a look at him is the dream of many women in this life. Fortunately for her, she was so lucky that she thought the color of shit was impure. However, trash is trash, and even if Huang Lengyue hooked up with Lian Chengmei, she would still be a pile of mud that couldn't hold up the wall. As long as a person with spiritual power moves his fingers, Huang Lengyue can be crushed to ashes. So everyone came to the same conclusion: a crow is always a crow and can never change into a phoenix! Even if it manages to fly onto a branch, it is just a chicken with phoenix feathers!", "title_en": "Chapter 6"}